  "snp2.13:8.2": "Neither Norman nor Bodhi note <i lang='pi' translate='no'>sandhiyatimeva</i> in identical context at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an3.132/en/sujato#3.2'>AN 3.132:3.2</a>. There Bodhi has “remains on friendly terms”, I have “stay in touch”. I assume there is a confusion of the negative which is required to give the correct sense. If I’m right, the corruption must predate the commentary. ",
